  <ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock id="f-26" contextRef="c-1">&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;9. For information on Legal Proceedings, see the December 31, 2025 Notes to Financial Statements - Note 3 - Regulatory Matters - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Provision for Rate Refund&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock>
