            <td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom">
              <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">NHT delivered 0 MWH of energy from the NEPOOL System to NextEra Energy Seabrook, LLC for the supply of off-line station service power under the ISO-NE Transmission, Markets and Services Tariff, FERC Tariff No. 3, during 2025.</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
